1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:03,150
In 2012, the world's fire record jumped.

2
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:05,950
The fires didn't change,
the satellites did.

3
00:00:06,420 --> 00:00:10,550
Zij links MODIS to VIIRS
and makes the records one.

4
00:00:10,620 --> 00:00:13,970
It maps fire in any area you choose,
month by month.

5
00:00:14,020 --> 00:00:18,380
It shows any day's fires,
from MODIS and VIIRS,

6
00:00:18,420 --> 00:00:22,180
side by side, and it gives you
clean, final data

7
00:00:22,220 --> 00:00:24,480
to plan, warn,
and respond to fires.

8
00:00:25,020 --> 00:00:27,350
1,000 years ago,
a zij charted the sky.

9
00:00:27,380 --> 00:00:29,300
Ours charts a safer Earth.
